{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "At the Movies", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Movie Talk", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 11, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 3, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A1.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Accurately explain information interests, hobbies, and preferences in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies general aspects of personal information in short written or spoken conversations about past experiences.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies general aspects of personal information in short written or spoken conversations about past experiences.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies general aspects of personal information in short written or spoken conversations about past experiences.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies general aspects of personal information in short written or spoken conversations about past experiences.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies general aspects of personal information in short written or spoken conversations about past experiences.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies general aspects of personal information in short written or spoken conversations about past experiences", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Identifies general aspects of personal information in short written or spoken conversations about past experiences.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn3le03ob11re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Let's Review the Simple Past Tense ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Use the Simple Past tense to talk about:<br /><br /><ol> <li>Finished time. </li> <li>Finished event. </li> <li>Specific time in the past.</li> </ol><br /><span class =\"strong\">Simple Past verb endings  </span>", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Add -ed, or -ied to regular verbs to form the Simple Past.<br /><br /><span class=\"italic\">Examples: <br>watch -- watched <br>work -- worked <br><br>Some verbs are irregular. <br><br /><span class=\"italic\">Examples:<br />see -- saw<br />take -- took<br />have -- had</span>\t\t", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\">Forms</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\">Example</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Affirmative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I worked from 9 - 11 p.m. <br />I saw a movie from 9 - 11 p.m.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Negative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I didn't walk to school. <br />I didn't drive to work.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Information question\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">What did you cook?<br /> What did you do?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Yes / No question\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Did you cook chicken?<br /> Did you do your homework?</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Let's Review Verbs with Infinitives", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Some verbs are followed by verbs in the Infinitive (to + verb) form.<br /> <br />Some verbs are: <br />prefer<br /> want<br /> need<br /> like", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "John likes to eat popcorn when he watches movies. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "She needs to leave early. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I really want to go to the game, but I don't like to play in bad weather.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "horror film ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a scary movie with frightening characters", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I like to watch horror films.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le03ob11aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are the words to review.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": " gore", "type": "name"}, {"content": "another word for horror or scary films", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I really like gore.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le03ob11aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "scary   ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "frightening", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I like to watch scary movies.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le03ob11aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "action movies ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "movies with many fight scenes", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I prefer to watch action films.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le03ob11aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "show ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a film or theatre performance", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: What show do you want to see?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le03ob11aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "matin\u00e9e   ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a movie show organized in the daytime, usually in the afternoon", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Let's see a matin\u00e9e.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le03ob11aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "special ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "organized or arranged for a particular event", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Let's have the popcorn special.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le03ob11aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Choose a movie (one in English is best).", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Watch it and write 6-8 sentences about it.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Share the information with your partner.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I report about events in the past.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I express intentions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I share my ideas with a partner about movies.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn3le03ob11re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn3le03ob11re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "", "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn3le03ob11re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Hi John. <br />\n<span class =\"strong\">John</span>: Hey, Sally. What's up?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>:  Vanessa and Peter saw a really exciting movie.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">John</span>: Really? When did they watch the film?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: They watched it on Thursday. It was a horror film.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">John</span>: Oh!<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'm a big fan of gore.  I want to watch this scary movie. Can you watch the horror movie with me?", "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn3le03ob11re2img05.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class =\"strong\">John</span>: Hmm, well, I prefer to watch action movies and reality TV shows, but I'll go with you.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Really? I didn't know you like to watch reality TV shows!<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">John</span>: Well, I do. What time do you want to see the show?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>:  Let's go for the matin\u00e9e. I need to get home early.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">John</span>: OK, sure.", "time": "24500"}, {"image": "engenn3le03ob11re2img01.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class =\"strong\">John</span>: Let's get some popcorn at the concession stand. How much for the popcorn?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Clerk</span>: The special is  $4.75.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">John</span>: Can we get the special, please?<br />", "time": "45000"}], "coverimg": "engenn3le03ob11re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": ""}, {"id": 2, "contents": [{"value": "engenn3le03ob11re2aud01", "type": "audio"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "text", "title": ""}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [0], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "I can talk about movies and food.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can make and respond to suggestions.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can express a goal or a purpose.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can talk about past experiences.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "What type of movies do you like? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "What about your friends? Do they like the same movies  